},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Mystic Birdhat says: Shine and rise.",
["id"] = "s0_10",
["timestamp"] = 1768685890,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Cousin Slowhands",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Cousin Slowhands says: Is it dangerous to go alone?",
["id"] = "s0_11",
["timestamp"] = 1768686376,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Human",
["class"] = "PALADIN",
["name"] = "Itashietsu-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
["type"] = "GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Itashietsu-Hyjal|h[|cfff48cbaItashietsu|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:9017:Player-1390-0D5763EC:1:1:17:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Water Management]|h|r !",
["id"] = "s0_12",
["timestamp"] = 1768686946,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Merrix",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Merrix says: Even though the Coreway is usable again, there is still plenty of construction work and rubble clearing needed.",
["id"] = "s0_13",
["timestamp"] = 1768932254,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: Ah, a prospective homeowner! Welcome to the neighborhood!",
["id"] = "s0_14",
["timestamp"] = 1768932400,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: I do enjoy a good stroll about town. Let's see what plots are available.",
["id"] = "s0_15",
["timestamp"] = 1768932419,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: And if you have any questions or find your options are too limited, please speak with me.",
["id"] = "s0_16",
["timestamp"] = 1768932426,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: The island's earliest register mentions an amnesiac dwarf found in the surf. Though his true identity is lost to us, this bridge he built serves as his legacy.",
["id"] = "s0_17",
["timestamp"] = 1768932492,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: The island's burial roll has been meticulously kept. Over fifty generations have called this place home. It is a fascinating read.",
["id"] = "s0_18",
["timestamp"] = 1768932514,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: The beacon on the bluff is one of the island's most historic landmarks. It is the first light seen by ships bound for Stormwind Harbor.",
["id"] = "s0_19",
["timestamp"] = 1768932542,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: In his logbook, Faldir expressed relief to find safe harbor here. This isle became a crucial foothold for the humans who first settled the south.",
["id"] = "s0_20",
["timestamp"] = 1768932566,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: Though the crops come and go with the season, these fields, orchards, and arbors have been here longer than the city of Stormwind.",
["id"] = "s0_21",
["timestamp"] = 1768932593,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: The locals have dubbed this hill the Small Aerie. Flocks of gryphons naturally tend to roost here.",
["id"] = "s0_22",
["timestamp"] = 1768932616,
},
